## 4. Manifest

### 4.1 File and packaging

A plugin package (`.rplugin`, a zip) contains:

```
plugin.json          # manifest (this schema)
dist/…               # runtime entry and bundled dependencies
assets/…             # icons, browser bundle for visualizations
CHANGELOG.md
SIGNATURE            # added by `rplugin pack --sign`; detached signature over MANIFEST.sha256
MANIFEST.sha256      # sha256 of every file in the package
```

