## Appendix A — Failure-mode matrix

| Scenario | Detected by | Result for user | Result for system |
|---|---|---|---|
| Plugin throws in `activate` | Lifecycle | Panel placeholder `PLUGIN_UNAVAILABLE` | `Failed` → backoff retries → quarantine after 5 |
| Handlers don't match manifest | Host step 7 | Placeholder | `Failed`, no retry; publish-time testkit should catch it |
| Infinite loop in handler | Deadline + heartbeat | Panel `TIMEOUT` | Cancel → strike → kill → restart |
| Memory leak | cgroup/RSS monitor | None (graceful reload) or `PLUGIN_CRASHED` on OOM | Reload (`unhealthy`) or restart |
| Returns malformed batch | Output validation | Panel `INVALID_PLUGIN_RESPONSE` | Health strike, alert team |
| Tries `fetch` to undeclared host | Egress proxy | Plugin sees `PERMISSION_DENIED` | Audit event, alert platform security |
| Tries direct socket / file write | OS sandbox | Plugin sees EACCES/ENETUNREACH | Seccomp/audit log |
| Reads data the user can't see | Broker principal check | `PERMISSION_DENIED` | Audit event |
| New version fails during upgrade | Reload step 1 | None; old version keeps serving | Version marked failed for tenant, alert |
| Upgrade needs new permissions | Resolution | None; stays on old version | Pending approval surfaced to tenant admin |
| Registry outage | Plugin Manager | None for running plugins | Cached packages used; installs/upgrades stall |
| Host deploy (rolling) | — | In-flight renders on draining nodes finish or retry | Unload reason `shutdown`; lazy reactivation on new nodes |
| Plugin version yanked | Registry event | None | Pinned tenants keep running, admin alerted; others resolve to next valid |
| Unknown enum / field from newer host | Tolerant reader | None | Documented fallback applied |
