      "allOf": [{ "$ref": "#/$defs/base" }],
      "required": ["uiEntry", "configSchema", "render"],
      "properties": {
        "id": true, "title": true, "description": true, "icon": true,
        "uiEntry": { "$ref": "#/$defs/relPath" },
        "configSchema": { "$ref": "#/$defs/relPath" },
        "render": { "type": "array", "minItems": 1, "uniqueItems": true, "items": { "enum": ["interactive", "headless"] } },
        "dataRequirements": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "maxRows": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1 },
            "fields": { "type": "array", "items": { "type": "object", "required": ["role", "types"], "properties": { "role": { "type": "string" }, "types": { "type": "array", "items": { "type": "string" } }, "required": { "type": "boolean" } } } }
          }
        }
      },
      "unevaluatedProperties": false
    },
    "exporter": {
      "allOf": [{ "$ref": "#/$defs/base" }],
      "required": ["mimeType", "fileExtension"],
      "properties": {
        "id": true, "title": true, "description": true, "icon": true,
        "mimeType": { "type": "string" },
        "fileExtension": { "type": "string", "pattern": "^\\.[a-z0-9]+$" },
        "optionsSchema": { "$ref": "#/$defs/relPath" }
      },
      "unevaluatedProperties": false
    },
    "destination": {
      "allOf": [{ "$ref": "#/$defs/base" }],
      "required": ["targetSchema"],
      "properties": {
        "id": true, "title": true, "description": true, "icon": true,
        "targetSchema": { "$ref": "#/$defs/relPath" },
        "acceptsMimeTypes": { "type": "array", "items": { "type": "string" } }
      },
      "unevaluatedProperties": false
    },
    "command": {
      "allOf": [{ "$ref": "#/$defs/base" }],
      "properties": {
        "id": true, "title": true, "description": true, "icon": true,
        "argsSchema": { "$ref": "#/$defs/relPath" },
        "placement": { "type": "array", "items": { "enum": ["reportToolbar", "widgetMenu", "datasetMenu"] } },
        "requiredRole": { "enum": ["viewer", "editor", "admin"], "default": "editor" }
      },
      "unevaluatedProperties": false
    },
    "service": {
      "allOf": [{ "$ref": "#/$defs/base" }],
      "required": ["interfaceVersion", "interface"],
      "properties": {
        "id": true, "title": true, "description": true, "icon": true,
        "interfaceVersion": { "$ref": "#/$defs/semver" },
        "interface": { "$ref": "#/$defs/relPath", "description": "JSON Schema describing methods, params, and results." }
      },
      "unevaluatedProperties": false
    }
  }
}
```

### 3.3 Validation rules beyond the schema (enforced by the Resolver)

1. Every `relPath` must exist in the package. Referenced schemas must be valid JSON Schema 2020-12.
2. Contribution `id`s must be unique within their type in the plugin.
3. `engines.reportingApi` must intersect the host's supported range (§7.1).
4. `dependencies` must resolve, must not contain cycles, and each consumed service must be provided by a declared dependency.
5. `version` must be greater than every published version of the same `id`. Published versions are immutable.
6. A capability or resource increase compared to the currently approved version needs re-approval (§5.4).
7. A new major version with existing saved reports needs `configMigrations: true` or an explicit "no config changes" attestation.

### 3.4 Package format

`<id>-<version>.rpx` = zip containing `plugin.json`, `dist/`, `schemas/`, `assets/`, `CHANGELOG.md`, and `SIGNATURE` (detached signature over a SHA-256 manifest of all files). No native binaries in v1. The Resolver rejects `.node` files and `postinstall` scripts. Dependencies are bundled at pack time, so nothing is installed at runtime.

