| Deliverable | Contents |
|---|---|
| `@reporting/plugin-api` | Types only (§7.4). Versioned exactly as `reportingApi` |
| `@reporting/plugin-sdk` | Runtime shim: RPC client, Arrow helpers, `definePlugin()`, AbortSignal plumbing |
| `@reporting/plugin-ui` | Browser SDK for visualizations, plus a React adapter (optional) |
