## 3. Manifest

### 3.1 Artifact layout

```
com.acme.salesforce-1.4.0.rplug        (tar.gz)
├── plugin.json                        manifest (required)
├── dist/server.js                     server entry (bundled, no install-time scripts)
├── dist/ui/                           optional client bundle(s)
├── schemas/*.json                     JSON Schemas referenced by the manifest
├── migrations/                        optional; referenced from code, not the manifest
├── sbom.cdx.json                      CycloneDX SBOM (required at publish)
├── README.md, CHANGELOG.md, icon.svg
└── (signature stored next to the artifact in the catalog, not inside it)
```

Rules: artifacts are fully bundled. The host never runs `npm install` or lifecycle scripts. The compressed artifact is at most 50 MB, and any single file uncompressed is at most 200 MB.

