## 3. Manifest

### 3.1 Artifact layout
```
com.acme.salesforce-1.4.0.rplug  (tar.gz)
├── plugin.json          manifest
├── dist/server.js       bundled entry (no npm install or lifecycle scripts, ever)
├── dist/ui/             optional client bundle
├── schemas/*.json       config schemas (versioned filenames)
├── sbom.cdx.json        required
└── README.md, CHANGELOG.md, icon.svg
```
The signature is stored next to the artifact in the catalog, not inside it. Limits: 50 MB compressed, 200 MB per file uncompressed.

