## 1. Architecture overview

```
                        ┌──────────────────────── Host process ────────────────────────┐
  Catalog (org-wide)    │                                                               │
  ┌──────────────┐      │  ┌──────────────┐   ┌───────────────┐   ┌──────────────────┐  │
  │ artifacts    │─────▶│  │ Plugin       │──▶│ Lifecycle     │──▶│ Invocation Router│◀─┼── Report engine,
  │ signatures   │      │  │ Registry     │   │ Manager       │   │ (callId, tenant, │  │   scheduler, API
  │ versions     │      │  │ (install/    │   │ (state machine│   │  deadlines)      │  │
  └──────────────┘      │  │  resolve)    │   │  supervisor)  │   └────────┬─────────┘  │
                        │  └──────────────┘   └───────┬───────┘            │            │
                        │                             │ spawn/kill         │ JSON-RPC + │
                        │  ┌──────────────────────────┴───┐                │ Arrow      │
                        │  │ Capability Broker            │◀───────────────┤            │
                        │  │ (permission checks: http,    │                │            │
                        │  │  storage, secrets, datasets) │                │            │
                        │  └──────────────────────────────┘                │            │
                        └──────────────────────────────────────────────────┼────────────┘
                                                                           │ unix socket
                              ┌────────────────────────────────────────────▼───────────┐
                              │ Sandbox (1 OS process per plugin version [per tenant]) │
                              │  nsjail/gVisor · cgroups · seccomp · no direct network │
                              │  ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────┐  │
                              │  │ SDK runtime shim  ──  plugin code (activate, …)   │  │
                              │  └──────────────────────────────────────────────────┘  │
                              └────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

  Browser: host page ──postMessage──▶ <iframe sandbox="allow-scripts"> plugin UI bundle (separate origin)
```

Core rules:
1. **Plugins never share a process or JS realm with the host.** The only way in or out is the RPC channel.
2. **Plugins have no ambient authority.** All I/O goes through the Capability Broker, which checks each call against the permissions granted in the manifest and against the tenant bound to the current invocation.
3. **The manifest is the source of truth.** Anything a plugin registers at runtime must already be declared, and permissions are only granted from the manifest.
4. **Plugin failures stay inside the plugin.** A crashing, slow, or leaking plugin degrades only its own contributions.

---

## 2. Extension points (contribution kinds)

| Kind | Purpose | Runs | Typical owner |
|---|---|---|---|
| `dataSource` | Connect to an external system, list datasets, run queries | Server sandbox | Integrations teams |
| `transform` | Table → table computation (enrichment, forecasting, anonymization) | Server sandbox | Analytics teams |
| `visualization` | Render a chart/widget from data | UI sandbox (+ optional server `prepare`) | Viz teams |
| `exporter` | Produce a file from a rendered report (xlsx, pdf variant, parquet) | Server sandbox | Output teams |
| `delivery` | Send an artifact to a destination (Slack, SFTP, S3) | Server sandbox | Integrations teams |
| `command` | User-invoked action on a report/dataset (e.g., "sync now") | Server sandbox | Any |

Every contribution gets a fully qualified ID, `<pluginId>/<contributionId>` (e.g., `finance.netsuite/netsuite-source`). Because IDs are namespaced by plugin, two plugins can never collide.

---

## 3. Manifest

File: `plugin.json` at the bundle root. It is validated against JSON Schema at pack time, at publish time, and at install time.

### 3.1 Example

```json
{
  "manifestVersion": 1,
  "id": "finance.netsuite",
  "version": "2.3.1",
  "displayName": "NetSuite Connector",
  "description": "Query NetSuite saved searches and SuiteQL.",
  "publisher": { "team": "finance-eng", "contact": "finance-eng@example.com" },
  "api": "^1.2.0",

  "runtime": { "kind": "node", "engine": "22", "entry": "dist/server.js" },
  "ui": { "entry": "dist/ui.js" },

  "activation": ["onContribution:netsuite-source", "onCommand:sync-now"],

  "contributes": {
    "dataSources": [
      {
        "id": "netsuite-source",
        "displayName": "NetSuite",
        "configVersion": 3,
        "configSchema": { "$ref": "./schemas/source-config.json" },
        "capabilities": { "filterPushdown": true, "aggregatePushdown": false, "incremental": true }
      }
    ],
    "commands": [
      { "id": "sync-now", "title": "Sync now", "scope": "dataset" }
    ]
  },

  "settings": {
    "schema": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "accountId": { "type": "string" },
        "tokenRef":  { "type": "string", "format": "secret-ref" },
        "pageSize":  { "type": "integer", "default": 1000, "minimum": 100, "maximum": 5000,
                       "x-restartRequired": false }
      },
      "required": ["accountId", "tokenRef"]
    }
  },

  "permissions": {
    "network": [{ "host": "*.suitetalk.api.netsuite.com", "ports": [443] }],
    "secrets": ["settings:tokenRef"],
    "storage": { "quotaMb": 50 },
    "datasets": "none"
  },

  "limits": {
    "memoryMb": 512,
    "callTimeoutMs": 120000,
    "maxConcurrency": 8
  },

  "experimental": []
}
```

### 3.2 Schema (JSON Schema 2020-12, normative)

```json
{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "https://plugins.reporting.internal/schema/manifest/v1.json",
  "type": "object",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "required": ["manifestVersion", "id", "version", "displayName", "publisher", "api", "runtime", "contributes", "permissions"],
  "properties": {
    "manifestVersion": { "const": 1 },
    "id": {
      "type": "string",
      "pattern": "^[a-z][a-z0-9-]*(\\.[a-z][a-z0-9-]*)+$",
      "maxLength": 100,
      "description": "<team>.<name>; immutable for the life of the plugin"
    },
    "version": { "type": "string", "pattern": "^\\d+\\.\\d+\\.\\d+(-[0-9A-Za-z.-]+)?$" },
    "displayName": { "type": "string", "maxLength": 80 },
    "description": { "type": "string", "maxLength": 500 },
    "publisher": {
      "type": "object", "additionalProperties": false, "required": ["team", "contact"],
      "properties": { "team": { "type": "string" }, "contact": { "type": "string", "format": "email" } }
    },
    "api": { "type": "string", "description": "npm-style semver range of the Plugin API, e.g. ^1.2.0" },

    "runtime": {
      "type": "object", "additionalProperties": false, "required": ["kind", "engine", "entry"],
      "properties": {
        "kind": { "enum": ["node"] },
        "engine": { "enum": ["22", "24"] },
        "entry": { "type": "string", "pattern": "^[^/].*\\.m?js$" }
      }
    },
    "ui": {
      "type": "object", "additionalProperties": false, "required": ["entry"],
      "properties": { "entry": { "type": "string" } }
    },

    "activation": {
      "type": "array", "uniqueItems": true,
      "items": { "type": "string", "pattern": "^(onStartup|onContribution:[a-z0-9-]+|onCommand:[a-z0-9-]+|onSchedule)$" },
      "default": []
    },

    "contributes": {
      "type": "object", "additionalProperties": false, "minProperties": 1,
      "properties": {
        "dataSources":    { "type": "array", "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/dataSource" } },
        "transforms":     { "type": "array", "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/contribution" } },
        "visualizations": { "type": "array", "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/visualization" } },
        "exporters":      { "type": "array", "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/exporter" } },
        "deliveries":     { "type": "array", "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/contribution" } },
        "commands":       { "type": "array", "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/command" } }
      }
    },

    "settings": {
      "type": "object", "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": { "schema": { "$ref": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema" } }
    },

    "permissions": {
      "type": "object", "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "network": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "object", "additionalProperties": false, "required": ["host"],
            "properties": {
              "host": { "type": "string", "description": "exact host or leading-wildcard *.domain; no IPs, no bare *" },
              "ports": { "type": "array", "items": { "type": "integer" }, "default": [443] },
              "protocol": { "enum": ["https", "tcp"], "default": "https" }
            }
          }
        },
        "secrets":  { "type": "array", "items": { "type": "string", "pattern": "^settings:[A-Za-z0-9_]+$" } },
        "storage":  { "type": "object", "properties": { "quotaMb": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0, "maximum": 1024 } } },
        "datasets": { "enum": ["none", "input", "read"], "default": "none",
                      "description": "input = only data passed to a call; read = may query host datasets as the invoking user" },
        "userIdentity": { "type": "boolean", "default": false }
      }
    },

    "limits": {
      "type": "object", "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "memoryMb":       { "type": "integer", "minimum": 64, "maximum": 4096, "default": 256 },
        "callTimeoutMs":  { "type": "integer", "minimum": 100, "maximum": 900000, "default": 30000 },
        "maxConcurrency": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1, "maximum": 64, "default": 4 },
        "idleUnloadSec":  { "type": "integer", "minimum": 60, "default": 900 }
      }
    },

    "experimental": { "type": "array", "items": { "type": "string" }, "default": [] }
  },

  "$defs": {
    "contribution": {
      "type": "object", "required": ["id", "displayName", "configVersion"],
      "properties": {
        "id": { "type": "string", "pattern": "^[a-z][a-z0-9-]{1,62}$" },
        "displayName": { "type": "string" },
        "configVersion": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1 },
        "configSchema": { "type": "object" }
      }
    },
    "dataSource": {
      "allOf": [{ "$ref": "#/$defs/contribution" }],
      "properties": {
        "capabilities": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "filterPushdown": { "type": "boolean" },
            "aggregatePushdown": { "type": "boolean" },
            "incremental": { "type": "boolean" }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "visualization": {
      "allOf": [{ "$ref": "#/$defs/contribution" }],
      "properties": {
        "dataShape": { "type": "object", "description": "required columns/roles, e.g. {x: temporal, y: quantitative[]}" },
        "serverPrepare": { "type": "boolean", "default": false },
        "printable": { "type": "boolean", "default": true }
      }
    },
    "exporter": {
      "allOf": [{ "$ref": "#/$defs/contribution" }],
      "required": ["mimeType", "extension"],
      "properties": { "mimeType": { "type": "string" }, "extension": { "type": "string" } }
    },
    "command": {
      "type": "object", "required": ["id", "title", "scope"],
      "properties": {
        "id": { "type": "string" }, "title": { "type": "string" },
        "scope": { "enum": ["global", "report", "dataset"] }
      }
    }
  }
}
```

### 3.3 Validation rules the schema cannot express

These are enforced by `rpt-plugin validate` and again at publish:
- `configVersion` never decreases across plugin versions. If it goes up, the plugin must implement `migrateConfig` (§5.5).
- Every `secrets` entry names a settings property with `format: "secret-ref"`.
- Network hosts: no IP literals, no internal/private ranges, no bare `*`.
- `permissions` or `limits` that go past org policy caps need an approval record (§8.3).
- Any `experimental` feature must be on the host's allowlist.
- Bundle rules: no `.node` files, entry must exist, bundle ≤ 50 MB, SBOM present.

