| 1–2 | Circulate this doc as an RFC. Publish `plugin-api@1.0.0-rc.1` (types and manifest schema). **Start a spike on network egress enforcement on your infrastructure: it's the critical-path risk.** | Each team maps its planned plugin onto the extension points and reports gaps *now* |
