## 2. Architecture overview

```
                        ┌──────────────────────── Control plane ────────────────────────┐
   CI (plugin repo) ──► │ Registry API ──► Registry DB (plugins, versions, installations)│
    build/sign/test     │      │                                                          │
                        │      └──► Package Store (content-addressed blobs, signatures)  │
                        └──────────────┬─────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
                                       │ change events (desired state)
   ┌───────────────────────── App node (N of these) ─────────────────────────────────────┐
   │  Report engine ──► Contribution Index ──► Supervisor (reconciler + lifecycle)        │
   │        │                                     │ spawn / health / drain / kill         │
   │        │ invoke                              ▼                                        │
   │        └──────────► Invocation Router ──► ┌───────────── Sandbox ─────────────┐       │
   │                                           │ Plugin process                    │       │
   │  Capability Broker ◄── RPC (framed) ──────┤  SDK runtime ── plugin bundle     │       │
   │   ├ HTTP/TCP egress gateway (allowlist)   └───────────────────────────────────┘       │
   │   ├ Secrets resolver (vault)                                                         │
   │   ├ KV storage (quota, scoped)                                                       │
   │   └ Logs / metrics / traces / audit                                                  │
   └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
   Browser: report UI ──postMessage──► sandboxed cross-origin iframe (visualization bundle)
```

