## 3. Package format

```
netsuite-2.3.1.rplugin            (zip, deterministic ordering)
├── plugin.json                   manifest (§4)
├── dist/index.mjs                server bundle — ALL dependencies bundled, no install step
├── dist/viz/*.mjs                browser bundles (visualizations only)
├── assets/                       icons, static files (read-only at runtime)
├── sbom.cdx.json                 CycloneDX SBOM
└── SIGNATURE                     detached signature over the sha256 of all other entries
```

Rules:
- Packages are produced **only by CI** from a tagged commit. The CI signing key is held in KMS; developer-signed packages are accepted only by the local dev host.
- No native addons unless the platform team approves (registry flag `allowNativeAddons`); if approved, the addon must be built for the host runtime image.
- Size cap is 50 MB compressed by default.
- Module top-level code must be side-effect free. Work belongs in `activate`. The testkit checks this by loading the bundle with all capabilities denied.

