| Milestone | Weeks | What ships | What it unblocks |
|---|---|---|---|
| **M0 Contract beta** | 1–3 | API 1.0-beta types and schemas, manifest v1, SDK, `rplugin dev` (process isolation + broker), core testkit suites, a reference plugin (CSV source + exporter) | **All five teams start building** |
