```
plugin.json
schemas/*.json
dist/server.js          # bundled; node_modules inlined, no native addons
dist/client.js          # optional, ESM, single file + assets/
assets/
CHANGELOG.md
```
`rpt-plugin pack` produces `<id>-<version>.rptp`, a zip with `plugin.json`, `SHA256SUMS`, and `signature`.

