| Artifact | Contents |
|---|---|
| `@reporting/plugin-api` | Generated types, one version per API minor |
| `@reporting/plugin-sdk` | Shim, `definePlugin`, `defineVisualizations`, Arrow helpers (`toRecordBatch`, `fromRows`), `PluginError` |
| `@reporting/plugin-testkit` | Mock host with permission enforcement, fixtures, the TCK |
| `rpt-plugin` CLI | `init <kind>`, `validate`, `dev`, `test`, `tck`, `pack`, `sign`, `publish`, `migrate-manifest` |
