## 2. Package format

```
com.acme.salesforce-1.4.0.rpx          (zip)
├── plugin.json                        manifest (§3)
├── dist/…                             runtime entry and code
├── ui/…                               optional iframe UI bundle (§7.5)
├── CHECKSUMS                          sha256 for every file
└── SIGNATURE                          detached signature over CHECKSUMS (internal CA)
```

- The registry records the package's SHA-256 digest at install time. The supervisor re-checks the digest **every time it loads the package**.
- Packages are published only through the CI pipeline. The pipeline signs the package after the conformance suite passes (§9).

