## 3. Manifest schema

### 3.1 Package layout

```
com.acme.finance.snowflake-1.4.2.rplug      (tar.gz)
├── plugin.json            manifest (this section)
├── dist/…                 entry + all dependencies vendored (no install-time downloads)
├── sbom.spdx.json         required
└── SIGNATURE              detached signature over the digest of all other files
```

### 3.2 Identity and naming rules

- `id`: reverse-DNS, at least 3 segments, `com.acme.<team>.<name>`. The team segment must match the publisher's registered namespace, and the registry enforces this.
- Contribution IDs are local to the plugin. Their global ID is `<pluginId>/<contributionId>`, so there are no cross-team collisions.
- `version`: SemVer 2.0. Published versions are immutable.

