# Reporting Tool: Plugin Architecture (Design v1)

## 0. Assumptions and open decisions

| # | Assumption | If wrong |
|---|---|---|
| A1 | The host is a server-side service and plugins run on the server | A desktop-only host needs a different sandbox (§5.3) |
| A2 | Production runs on Linux; Windows and macOS are only for development | Windows production needs AppContainer and Job Objects as the enforced boundary |
| A3 | Plugins come from internal teams, but a buggy or compromised plugin must not crash the host or leak data | Third-party plugins would need mandatory review and stronger isolation (gVisor or microVMs) |
| A4 | Deployments may be multi-tenant | With a single tenant, each plugin can have one shared worker (§5.2) |
| A5 | Plugins are written in TypeScript/Node or Python | Other languages need an SDK; the wire protocol already works with any language |

**Open decisions, with my recommendation for each:**
1. **Isolation technology:** nsjail plus cgroups for v1, rather than gVisor.
2. **Interface definition format (IDL):** OpenRPC plus JSON Schema, because it matches JSON-RPC. Protobuf/gRPC is the alternative.
3. **Plugin code running in the browser:** defer to v1.1. Charts generated on the server cover most needs.
4. **WASM for pure transforms:** defer. It can be added later as a new `runtime.kind` without changing the contract.

## 1. Goals and non-goals

**Goals**
- Five teams can build plugins in parallel against a frozen, documented, versioned contract.
- A plugin can't crash, hang or starve the host or other plugins, and can't read anything it wasn't granted.
- Plugins can be installed, upgraded, rolled back, reloaded and removed without restarting the host.
- The host can evolve without breaking plugins, through an explicit compatibility policy that CI enforces.

**Non-goals for v1**
- A public marketplace.
- Plugins running inside the host process. No plugin skips the sandbox.
- Plugins calling each other directly. All plugin-to-plugin calls go through the host.

## 2. Architecture overview

```
                  ┌──────────────────────── Host process ────────────────────────┐
Admin UI / CLI ──►│ Registry API ──► Installation Registry (DB)                  │
Publish pipeline ►│ Package Store (immutable, content-addressed, signed)          │
                  │ Contribution Index (lists what exists without starting it)    │
Report engine ───►│ Plugin Router ──► Lifecycle Manager ──► Worker Supervisor     │
                  │      ▲          Capability Broker ◄────────┤ spawn/kill/limit │
                  │      │   (data, net, kv, secrets, events,  │                  │
                  │      │    services, logs, metrics, audit)  │                  │
                  └──────┼─────────────────────────────────────┼──────────────────┘
                         │ control: JSON-RPC 2.0 · data: Arrow IPC streams
                  ┌──────┴─────────────────────────────────────▼──────────────────┐
                  │ Sandboxed worker (one per plugin version × tenant)             │
                  │  SDK runtime → plugin code · no network, read-only FS, cgroups │
                  └────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

| Component | Responsibility |
|---|---|
| Package Store | Stores plugin packages immutably, keyed by SHA-256 digest, and verifies signatures |
| Installation Registry | Records, per environment and tenant: installed version, granted permissions, config, secret references and enabled state |
| Contribution Index | Maps each global contribution ID (a single datasource, chart type, etc.) to its installation, so contributions can be listed without starting workers |
| Lifecycle Manager | Runs the state machine in §4: activation, reload, upgrade, migration and quarantine |
| Worker Supervisor | Starts sandboxed processes, applies limits, checks health, and restarts or kills them |
| Plugin Router | Sends each call to the active worker; handles concurrency, deadlines, cancellation and draining |
| Capability Broker | The only way a plugin can reach anything outside its sandbox; checks permissions and writes the audit log |

## 3. Manifest schema

### 3.1 Package layout
```
com.acme.finance.snowflake-1.4.2.rplug   (tar.gz)
├── plugin.json        manifest
├── dist/…             entry point plus all dependencies bundled (nothing downloaded at install)
├── sbom.spdx.json     required
└── SIGNATURE          detached signature over the digest of all other files
```

### 3.2 Naming rules
- **Plugin `id`:** reverse-DNS with at least 3 segments, `com.acme.<team>.<name>`. The registry checks that the team segment belongs to the publisher.
- **Contribution IDs:** local to the plugin. The global ID is `<pluginId>/<contributionId>`, so teams can't collide.
- **`version`:** SemVer 2.0. A published version can never change.

### 3.3 JSON Schema (manifest v1)
```json
{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "https://schemas.reporting.internal/plugin-manifest/v1.json",
  "type": "object", "additionalProperties": false,
  "required": ["manifestVersion","id","version","displayName","publisher","engines","runtime","contributes"],
  "properties": {
    "manifestVersion": { "const": 1 },
    "id": { "type": "string", "maxLength": 128, "pattern": "^[a-z][a-z0-9-]*(\\.[a-z][a-z0-9-]*){2,}$" },
    "version": { "$ref": "#/$defs/semver" },
    "displayName": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 80 },
    "description": { "type": "string", "maxLength": 500 },
    "license": { "type": "string" },
    "publisher": { "type": "object", "additionalProperties": false, "required": ["team","contact"],
      "properties": { "team": { "type": "string", "pattern": "^[a-z][a-z0-9-]*$" },
                      "contact": { "type": "string", "format": "email" },
                      "repository": { "type": "string", "format": "uri" } } },
    "engines": { "type": "object", "additionalProperties": false, "required": ["hostApi"],
      "properties": { "hostApi": { "$ref": "#/$defs/semverRange" } } },
    "runtime": { "type": "object", "additionalProperties": false, "required": ["kind","entry"],
      "properties": { "kind": { "enum": ["node","python"] },
                      "runtimeVersion": { "type": "string" },
                      "entry": { "type": "string", "pattern": "^[^/][^:]*$" },
                      "limits": { "$ref": "#/$defs/limits" } } },
    "activation": { "type": "array", "uniqueItems": true, "default": ["onContribution"],
      "items": { "type": "string", "pattern": "^(onStartup|onContribution|onEvent:[a-z][a-z0-9.*-]*|onSchedule)$" } },
    "permissions": { "type": "array", "uniqueItems": true, "default": [], "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/permission" } },
    "configuration": { "type": "object", "description": "JSON Schema for admin settings; must not contain secrets" },
    "secrets": { "type": "array", "default": [], "items": { "type": "object", "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["name","description"],
      "properties": { "name": { "type": "string", "pattern": "^[A-Z][A-Z0-9_]{0,63}$" },
                      "description": { "type": "string" }, "required": { "type": "boolean", "default": true } } } },
    "provides": { "type": "array", "default": [], "items": { "type": "object", "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["service","version"],
      "properties": { "service": { "type": "string", "pattern": "^[a-z][a-z0-9-]*$" },
                      "version": { "$ref": "#/$defs/semver" }, "schema": { "type": "string" } } } },
    "consumes": { "type": "array", "default": [], "items": { "type": "object", "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": ["plugin","service","range"],
      "properties": { "plugin": { "type": "string" }, "service": { "type": "string" },
                      "range": { "$ref": "#/$defs/semverRange" }, "optional": { "type": "boolean", "default": false } } } },
    "contributes": { "type": "object", "additionalProperties": false, "minProperties": 1,
      "properties": {
        "datasources":    { "type": "array", "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/datasource" } },
        "transforms":     { "type": "array", "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/transform" } },
        "visualizations": { "type": "array", "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/visualization" } },
        "exporters":      { "type": "array", "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/exporter" } },
        "actions":        { "type": "array", "items": { "$ref": "#/$defs/action" } } } }
  },
  "$defs": {
    "semver": { "type": "string", "pattern": "^(0|[1-9]\\d*)\\.(0|[1-9]\\d*)\\.(0|[1-9]\\d*)(-[0-9A-Za-z.-]+)?(\\+[0-9A-Za-z.-]+)?$" },
    "semverRange": { "type": "string", "minLength": 1, "maxLength": 64 },
    "permission": { "type": "string",
      "pattern": "^(data:(read|write):[A-Za-z0-9_.*/-]+|net:connect:[a-z0-9.*-]+(:[0-9]{1,5})?|storage:(kv|blob)|events:(subscribe|publish):[a-z0-9.*-]+|reports:(read|write)|services:call:[a-z0-9.-]+/[a-z0-9-]+)$" },
    "limits": { "type": "object", "additionalProperties": false, "properties": {
      "memoryMb":            { "type": "integer", "minimum": 64,  "maximum": 4096,   "default": 512 },
      "cpuMillicores":       { "type": "integer", "minimum": 100, "maximum": 4000,   "default": 1000 },
      "callTimeoutMs":       { "type": "integer", "minimum": 100, "maximum": 300000, "default": 30000 },
      "activationTimeoutMs": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 100, "maximum": 60000,  "default": 10000 },
      "maxConcurrency":      { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1,   "maximum": 64,     "default": 4 },
      "tmpDiskMb":           { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0,   "maximum": 2048,   "default": 128 } } },
    "contributionBase": { "type": "object", "required": ["id","displayName"], "properties": {
      "id": { "type": "string", "pattern": "^[a-z][a-z0-9-]{0,62}$" },
      "displayName": { "type": "string", "maxLength": 80 },
      "description": { "type": "string", "maxLength": 500 },
      "stability": { "enum": ["stable","preview"], "default": "stable" } } },
    "datasource": { "allOf": [{ "$ref": "#/$defs/contributionBase" }], "required": ["connectionSchema"], "properties": {
      "connectionSchema": { "type": "object" },
      "pushdown": { "type": "array", "uniqueItems": true, "items": { "enum": ["filter","projection","sort","limit","aggregate"] } },
      "incremental": { "type": "boolean", "default": false } } },
    "transform": { "allOf": [{ "$ref": "#/$defs/contributionBase" }], "required": ["inputs"], "properties": {
      "inputs": { "type": "object", "required": ["min","max"], "properties": {
        "min": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 0 }, "max": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1 } } },
      "parametersSchema": { "type": "object" },
      "deterministic": { "type": "boolean", "default": true } } },
    "visualization": { "allOf": [{ "$ref": "#/$defs/contributionBase" }], "required": ["output"], "properties": {
      "output": { "enum": ["vega-lite","svg"] }, "optionsSchema": { "type": "object" }, "dataShape": { "type": "object" } } },
    "exporter": { "allOf": [{ "$ref": "#/$defs/contributionBase" }], "required": ["formats"], "properties": {
      "formats": { "type": "array", "minItems": 1, "items": { "type": "object", "required": ["mimeType","extension"],
        "properties": { "mimeType": { "type": "string" }, "extension": { "type": "string" } } } },
      "optionsSchema": { "type": "object" } } },
    "action": { "allOf": [{ "$ref": "#/$defs/contributionBase" }], "required": ["trigger"], "properties": {
      "trigger": { "enum": ["event","schedule","manual"] },
      "events": { "type": "array", "items": { "type": "string" } }, "optionsSchema": { "type": "object" } } }
  }
}
```

