## 5. Manifest (`plugin.json`)

### 5.1 Package layout

```
finance.netsuite-1.4.2.rptp        (tar.gz, immutable once published)
├─ plugin.json
├─ dist/server.js                  runtime.entry: bundled, node_modules inlined
├─ dist/ui.js                      ui.entry (if any)
├─ assets/…
├─ CHECKSUMS                       sha256 of every file
└─ SIGNATURE                       signature over CHECKSUMS, made by the CI signing key
```

Packages may not contain native addons (`.node`) or symlinks, and are capped at 50 MB unpacked for the internal tier.

