## 2. Architecture overview

```
┌──────────────────────────────── Host (reporting service) ──────────────────────────────────┐
│                                                                                            │
│  Report engine ──► Contribution Router ──► Plugin Runtime Manager ──► Sandbox Driver       │
│        │                  ▲                     │  lifecycle FSM          (nsjail/process/ │
│        │                  │                     │  health, restarts        microvm/wasm)   │
│        │           Runtime Registry ◄───────────┘  scaling, draining             │         │
│        │         (active instances +                                            │         │
│        │          contribution index)                                           │         │
│        │                  ▲                                                     │         │
│        │                  │ install/enable events                               │         │
│        │           Catalog + Installation DB ◄── Registry API ◄── CLI / Admin UI │         │
│        │                  ▲                                                     │         │
│        │                  │ pull + verify                                       │         │
│        │           OCI Artifact Store (signed bundles)                          │         │
│        │                                                                        │         │
│        └──────────► Capability Broker ◄──── gRPC over UDS (control + Arrow data) ─┤         │
│                     (data, http, secrets,                                       │         │
│                      kv, blob, notify, log/metrics)                             │         │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼─────────┘
                                                                                  │
                                         ┌────────── Sandbox (one per plugin instance) ─────┐
                                         │  SDK runtime (Node / Python)                     │
                                         │    ├─ protocol client, handshake, cancellation   │
                                         │    ├─ typed ctx.* capability proxies             │
                                         │  Plugin code (activate / handlers / deactivate)  │
                                         │  no network · RO fs + tmp quota · cgroup limits  │
                                         └──────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

Browser:  Report viewer ──postMessage (versioned)──► <iframe sandbox> visualization client bundle
```

**Two planes:**
- **Control plane:** registry, catalog, installation, lifecycle. Low volume, strongly consistent.
- **Data plane:** invocations such as queries, transforms, renders and exports. High volume, deadline-bound, streaming.

