| Weeks | Platform deliverables | Plugin teams |
|---|---|---|
| **0–2** | Manifest v1 + API `1.0.0-rc.1` frozen for review; SDK + testkit alpha (in-memory host, no sandbox); `create-report-plugin`; one reference plugin per contribution type | RFC review of the API; each team files its contribution list and permission needs |
| **3–5** | Supervisor + process sandbox (Linux + Windows dev); wire protocol + streaming; broker for http/secrets/storage; `rpt-plugin dev` | Build against the testkit; first end-to-end run in dev host |
| **6–8** | Registry (catalog, installations, grants, config), CLI publish, signing, admin API/UI; lazy activation, unload, idle; fault policy; telemetry | **`1.0.0-rc.2`: last chance for breaking changes, based on real plugin feedback** |
