| `version` | ✔ | semver 2.0 | |
| `displayName` / `description` | ✔ / – | 1–80 / ≤500 chars | |
| `publisher.team` `.contact` `.oncall` | ✔ | team slug; email; pager rotation ID | |
| `publisher.repository` | – | URI | |
| `engines.pluginApi` | ✔ | `^x.y.z`, `~x.y.z`, or `>=x.y.z <X.0.0`. **Must stay within one major.** | |
| `engines.host` | – | semver range | any |
| `runtime` | if any backend contribution | `{type: "node", entry: <relative path, no "..">, nodeMajor: 22\|24}` | |
| `ui.entry` | if `visualizations` is present | relative path to HTML | |
| `activation.mode` | – | `lazy` \| `eager` | `lazy` |
| `activation.idleUnloadAfterSeconds` | – | 60–86400 (ignored for eager) | 900 |
| `isolation.mode` | – | `shared` \| `per-tenant` | `shared` |
| `isolation.maxInstancesPerNode` | – | 1–1000 (per-tenant only; least recently used is evicted) | 50 |
