| `permissions.network.egress[]` | – | `{host: hostname or *.suffix, ports: int[1..65535], purpose: string}` | none |
| `permissions.secrets[]` | – | `{name: ^[A-Z][A-Z0-9_]{0,63}$, scope: plugin\|tenant, description}` | none |
| `permissions.storage` | – | `{scopes: [global\|tenant]+, quotaMb: 1–1024}` | none / 50 |
