## 2. Manifest schema

`plugin.json` at package root. Parsed and fully validated **before any plugin code loads** — everything needed to resolve, permission, and lazily activate must be expressible declaratively.

### 2.1 Annotated reference

```jsonc
{
  "manifestVersion": 1,              // schema generation; host supports current + previous

  "id": "com.acme.snowflake",        // reverse-DNS, IMMUTABLE. Changing it = a new plugin,
                                     // not an upgrade. ^[a-z0-9-]+(\.[a-z0-9-]+){2,}$
  "name": "Snowflake Connector",
  "version": "1.4.2",                // SemVer of the PLUGIN, independent of API version
  "publisher": "acme",               // must match signing key binding in signed/trusted channels
  "license": "Apache-2.0",

  "engines": {
    "api": "^2.3",                   // SemVer range over @reporting/plugin-api. REQUIRED.
    "host": ">=4.2.0"                // optional; prefer api + feature detection
  },
  "protocol": 1,                     // wire framing generation, independent of API surface

  "isolation": "worker",             // in-process | worker | process | wasm
                                     // host may DOWNGRADE to stricter by policy, never upgrade

  "main": "./dist/main.js",          // server entry, exports activate()
  "browser": "./dist/view.js",       // browser entry, loaded into sandboxed iframe

  "activationEvents": [              // empty list = never activated
    "onDataSourceType:snowflake"     // "onStartup" requires platform-team review
  ],                                 // (it is charged against the cold-start budget)

  "contributes": { /* see 2.2 */ },
  "permissions":  { /* see 5.3 */ },
  "previewFeatures": [],             // opt-in unstable surface; rejected in `stable` channel

  "dependencies": {
    "plugins": {
      "com.acme.auth-oauth": { "version": "^2.0", "optional": false }
    }
  },

  "exports": { /* JSON Schema */ },  // shape of activate()'s return value, published to
                                     // dependents; non-additive change = MAJOR of this plugin

  "configSchema": { /* JSON Schema */ },  // drives admin settings UI, validated host-side

  "resources": {
    "memoryMb": 512,                 // host CLAMPS to the tier policy max; never grants more
    "activateTimeoutMs": 10000,      //   than requested
    "deactivateTimeoutMs": 5000,
    "callTimeoutMs": 30000,
    "maxConcurrentCalls": 8
  },

  "integrity": {                     // written by the packaging tool, verified pre-extraction
    "algorithm": "sha512",
    "digest": "…",
    "signature": "…",
    "keyId": "…"
  }
}
```

**Cross-field constraints enforced by the schema:**
- `permissions.spawn` present ⟹ `isolation` must be `"process"`.
- At least one of `main` / `browser` required.
- `net.egress` may not be `["*"]` outside the `dev` channel.

